  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: Additive release with the new host-owned security execution-context provider contract and, for the GraphQL adapter, the secure FoundgineHotChocolateQueryExecutor. The Supply Chain reference sample is source-integrated against this release line. 1.0.0: Semver stability declaration only; no runtime capability change since 0.5.0. 0.5.0: Packaging/documentation cleanup only; no core facade runtime capability change. 0.3.0: Foundgine's semantic execution architecture became a validated release surface covering intent, semantics, planning, authorization-aware execution, deterministic fingerprints, and provider integration.",
